# A CodeQL query suite (.qls) is a YAML list of instructions that selects
# which queries to run. The simplest suite just says "run every .ql file in
# this pack" — that's what we do here.
#
# You can also filter by tag, id, or metadata, e.g.:
#   - queries: '.'
#   - include:
#       tags contain: security
#       precision: high
#
# Docs: https://codeql.github.com/docs/codeql-cli/creating-codeql-query-suites/

- description: "codeqldemo custom queries — demo of writing your own .ql/.qls"
- queries: '.'
